img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109071203471360028761.jpeg/v6wDOqIM0j_8GKTrsnv5u2CDhhYG2mabgEGH-IBBh_g\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣著名模特林志玲。（IG@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260415/1121035133328035840319478.jpeg/FdN9G3gCOduE5gQakmg_uRPp8u-f2pO0uI9ltLiPZbQ\"/><figcaption>台灣著名模特林志玲。（IG@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲慶祝51歲生日。(小紅書)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073232948322635776012935.jpeg/ZSMFK_-hXrhlG2v8F6gzcmtNhiIB2qwyHZomgh2aJoI\"/><figcaption>林志玲慶祝51歲生日。(小紅書)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲慶祝51歲生日。(小紅書)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073232946531536896764108.jpeg/ocY2w2hG8YjI11MinOhITOWBFUb0NxEBedqIa3naiGs\"/><figcaption>林志玲慶祝51歲生日。(小紅書)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲慶祝51歲生日。(小紅書)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073232944224538624634051.jpeg/0XMS2p79PPPL_DtPUAsbYj8G8r--SJgGmJYNxpiWDcY\"/><figcaption>林志玲慶祝51歲生日。(小紅書)</figcaption></figure><p>英國民調機構YouGov在2014年的調查則提供了歐美男生的具體數字：一般男性心目中女性的理想身高是5呎6吋（約168cm），要矮至4呎11吋才嫌太矮，高至6呎（約183cm）才嫌太高。</p><p>近年亦有研究從性別角色角度切入，認為越重視身高、越自認傳統陽剛的男性，越不願意接受比自己高的伴侶。綜合東西方的研究，男生對女方身高的要求普遍比女生對男方的要求寬鬆；《Frontiers in Psychology》2022年的論文回顧多項研究亦指出，學術界一直發現男性對女性身高的偏好較弱、較不一致。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:04:02.449703+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":8409,"images":151,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:25:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T09:57:28.957625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:57:27.755008+00:00","content_hash":"21859966fa77d3326fabdabf09fab863129432af1e4315f08c46336b567501e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}